  "comments": "<p><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6540071984a49.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6540071984a49.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br>Coins with mintmark were struck in the Philippines. Coins without mintmark were struck in Canada by RCM in 1995, 1997 and 1998.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/625bf732c4ed6.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/625bf732c4ed6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5c8a913929589.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5c8a913929589.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br>There are 4 main types of the reverse.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/62bcbd59d46f6.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/62bcbd59d46f6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67b336f391b31.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67b336f391b31.jpg\"></a></p><p>This new coin discovered has no STARS on the three corners.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\">There is R3-Thin in 2013. See comparison:</p><p style=\"margin-left:0.0px;\"><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/661106cd38682.png\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/661106cd38682.png\"></a><br>&nbsp;</p>",
